<iscontent type="text/html" charset="UTF-8" compact="true"/>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0" />

    <isif condition="${pdict.viteTags}">
        <isprint value="${pdict.viteTags}" encoding="off"/>
    </isif>
</head>
<body>
    <iscomment>
        The @inertiajs v3.6 client boots from this JSON script tag
        (script[data-page="app"][type="application/json"]) and mounts into the
        empty #app div. pageJson is pre-escaped by the adapter (angle brackets are JSON-escaped so a prop value can never break out of this script tag).
    </iscomment>
    <script data-page="app" type="application/json"><isprint value="${pdict.pageJson}" encoding="off"/></script>
    <div id="app"></div>
</body>
</html>
